include LICENSE
include README.md
include CHANGELOG.md
include CONTRIBUTING.md
include SECURITY.md
include pyproject.toml

prune artifacts
prune docs
prune experiments
prune scripts
prune sim
prune tests

recursive-include src/gauntlet *.py
